00:14:52.489 --> 00:14:54.265
- First thing is you want
to create a unifying brand.

00:14:54.265 --> 00:14:56.171
So, across all your social media accounts

00:14:56.171 --> 00:14:57.652
and your website, go ahead and make sure

00:14:57.652 --> 00:14:59.978
you're unified with your vision.

00:14:59.978 --> 00:15:03.773
You don't want to have, Steve, the good

00:15:03.773 --> 00:15:06.248
looking TV guy as your Twitter handle,

00:15:06.248 --> 00:15:09.399
then Steve GDLA on Instagram.

00:15:09.399 --> 00:15:10.547
You want to have a unified vision.

00:15:10.547 --> 00:15:11.380
- All the way through.

00:15:11.380 --> 00:15:12.530
- All the way across,
yeah, keep it the same.

00:15:12.530 --> 00:15:14.323
Or just your first name and
last name all the way across.

00:15:14.323 --> 00:15:15.911
- You don't want to make stuff up.

00:15:15.911 --> 00:15:18.723
Like the skinny tie wearer guy.

00:15:18.723 --> 00:15:19.922
- You want to make it as easy as possible

00:15:19.922 --> 00:15:21.491
for people to remember you
and see your account set.

00:15:21.491 --> 00:15:22.324
- Got it.

00:15:22.324 --> 00:15:23.888
- Creating a unique and powerful website.

00:15:23.888 --> 00:15:25.221
What is that?

00:15:25.221 --> 00:15:26.742
- Yeah, you can't really
have a powerful brand

00:15:26.742 --> 00:15:28.244
if you don't have a home base.

00:15:28.244 --> 00:15:29.656
A place where people can go to.

00:15:29.656 --> 00:15:31.913
So you build your accounts
on Twitter and Instagram.

00:15:31.913 --> 00:15:34.136
You want to send people back to one place.

00:15:34.136 --> 00:15:35.383
Sent them back to a place where they

00:15:35.383 --> 00:15:36.601
can learn more about you.

00:15:36.601 --> 00:15:37.566
- So if you have multi platforms,

00:15:37.566 --> 00:15:39.807
you're getting in the way of yourself?

00:15:39.807 --> 00:15:41.038
- you're not getting
in the way of yourself.

00:15:41.038 --> 00:15:42.312
You just want to direct them to one place.

00:15:42.312 --> 00:15:43.145
- One source.

00:15:43.145 --> 00:15:43.978
- That's going to help you--

00:15:43.978 --> 00:15:44.811
- You can pay people to do this.

00:15:44.811 --> 00:15:46.009
- Here's what I love.

00:15:46.009 --> 00:15:47.618
I love this one, number three.

00:15:47.618 --> 00:15:49.130
Go against the grain.

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:50.165
- Yeah, there's a lot of people,

00:15:50.165 --> 00:15:51.861
if you're working in an industry,

00:15:51.861 --> 00:15:53.259
you want to stand out in that industry.

00:15:53.259 --> 00:15:54.758
So you want to build a personal brand

00:15:54.758 --> 00:15:56.495
that's unique, that's different,

00:15:56.495 --> 00:16:00.150
that says something that is
different than everyone else.

00:16:00.150 --> 00:16:01.788
- People will pay attention
to the difference.

00:16:01.788 --> 00:16:03.312
- You want to pay attention to that.

00:16:03.312 --> 00:16:04.827
Figure out creative ways.

00:16:04.827 --> 00:16:06.168
It doesn't have to be a set way

00:16:06.168 --> 00:16:07.875
that everyone else is doing something.

00:16:07.875 --> 00:16:09.569
If you've got an idea.

00:16:09.569 --> 00:16:10.719
If you've got an audience.

00:16:10.719 --> 00:16:13.028
If you've got an offer, or product,

00:16:13.028 --> 00:16:14.962
then get creative of how you can

00:16:14.962 --> 00:16:19.135
bring an income or make money
around that creative idea.

00:16:19.135 --> 00:16:21.597
You think you have to be perfect

00:16:21.597 --> 00:16:23.039
before you can really launch.

00:16:23.039 --> 00:16:24.889
I see this all the time, especially

00:16:24.889 --> 00:16:26.470
with online entrepreneurs, where they

00:16:26.470 --> 00:16:29.366
want to have the perfect
logo, or the perfect design,

00:16:29.366 --> 00:16:32.573
or they want to package
the product perfectly.

00:16:32.573 --> 00:16:34.308
But really, that's just holding you back

00:16:34.308 --> 00:16:36.476
from being successful.

00:16:36.476 --> 00:16:38.749
Now, good and profitable, is better

00:16:38.749 --> 00:16:40.793
than perfect and not done.

00:16:40.793 --> 00:16:42.711
So make sure to get the product done.

00:16:42.711 --> 00:16:46.711
Get the service done and
then make it profitable

